WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.220
Training → Activities lists all your workouts, newest first.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.434
Pick a period and a sport…

00:00:11.484 --> 00:00:16.388
…or search by name.

00:00:16.438 --> 00:00:20.549
An activity: map, charts, laps and zones.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:24.400
Say how hard it felt: it counts in the advice.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:30.801
Scroll for pace, heart rate and the split over your zones.
